# A variadic definition: va_start reads a register save area the translator
# allocates ('__va_area__' is in the locals) but never fills, so selection
# refuses the whole function. Calling a variadic function is unaffected and is
# selected - only being one is the problem. Delete this file once variadic
# definitions land (step 14 of docs/ir-codegen-design.md).
sum_varargs
